<lb n="12"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diwil</unclear> aber er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Heer</unclear>, mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sines</unclear> schwagers s. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voegte</unclear>
